[41.941423, "o", "> "]
[41.941445, "o", "+\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[41.941462, "o", "> "]
[41.94167, "o", "+    Expected format: base64‑url encoding of ``\"{created_at}|{id}\"``.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[41.941693, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[41.94171, "o", "> "]
[41.941984, "o", "+    If decoding fails or the components are malformed, a ``400 Bad Request`` is raised.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[41.942006, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[41.942035, "o", "+    \"\"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[41.942058, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[41.942127, "o", "+    if raw is None:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[41.942145, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[41.942162, "o", "> "]
